  "text": "```ruby\ndef titleize_sentence(sentence)\n  # Define words that should remain lowercase\n  lowercase_words = %w[and the or in with of]\n  \n  # Split the sentence into words, titleize each word, then join them back\n  sentence.split.map do |word|\n    # Check if the word is in the lowercase list (case-insensitive check)\n    if lowercase_words.include?(word.downcase)\n      word.downcase\n    else\n      word.capitalize\n    end\n  end.join(' ')\nend\n```"
